## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Build results
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
*.log

# Visual Studio
.vs/

# Rider
.idea/

# Others
*.dbmdl
*.pdb
*.cache
*.config
*.dll
*.exe

# ASP.NET specific
appsettings.*.json
.env

# dotnet watch
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
